      "content": "idk i dont really want to go to the er if i dont have to... it's always so expensive and honestly i just feel like if i can just get my sugar levels down and drink enough water i'll be fine. like, can't i just take some extra insulin now to fix it and see how i feel in an hour? is that safe to try?",
